# Build the council seats this context's gate decisions read: its reviewer
# chain, its house rules, and its judge's (docs/council.md, "Council v2
# seats"). They build in the background, so the first decision finds them
# held instead of building them on its deadline. A context whose performer's
# layers enable no council builds nothing, and so does the console and a
# person's root console, which are never under a council.
kj council build
